      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No 20 Hibernian Buildings offers an opportunity to acquire an own door two-bedroom house on Albert Road just around the corner from Shalom Park and the offices blocks at Albert Quay. \r\n\r\nThe property is a short walk to Patrick Street with all amenities and to Marina Park for the best in leisure facilities of the Marino Market, river walks & parks, Páirc Uí Chaoimh and the music venue The Marquee. \r\n\r\nThe property is a two-bedroom terraced dwelling constructed in late 1800’s and has a single-storey extension to the rear. The house while in need of modernisation would offer the very best of city living. \r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor: 2 Small Living Rooms, Kitchen, Bathroom.\r\nFirst Floor: 2 Bedrooms.\r\nFloor Area: 55m2\r\nSmall Yard to the rear\r\nSee floor plans for details.\r\n\r\nMains services. No heating.\r\n\r\nBER: G 119541118"
      }
